# Build artifacts of the standalone org/streaming API probe. It has its OWN
# workspace root, so the repository root ignore rules do not reach it.
# `Cargo.lock` is deliberately NOT ignored: the probe resolves independently of
# the parent lockfile, and CI runs it with `--locked`, so the committed
# lockfile is what keeps a fresh CI run from selecting different transitive
# versions than the one this probe was verified against.
target/
